# {{lb|de|rare|specialist}} [[onomatopoeia]] (the use of language whose sound imitates that which it names; the property of a word of sounding like what it represents; the [[coining]] of a word in imitation of a sound)

====Usage notes====
* This word will be unintelligible to many, even educated speakers. The usual word in German is {{m|de|Lautmalerei|lit=sound painting}}.

